## 6. Data Flow

### 6.1 Item Creation Flow

```
User Input (Streamlit)
  ↓
CompliantFlowCore.create_item()
  ↓
WorkflowEngine.get_initial_state()
  ↓
ItemSaver.save(item)
  ↓
YAML File + Git Commit
  ↓
GraphEngine.rebuild()
```

### 6.2 Traceability Analysis Flow

```
User Request (Streamlit)
  ↓
CompliantFlowCore.get_traceability()
  ↓
GraphEngine.build_from_items()
  ↓
NetworkX Graph Operations
  ↓
Traceability Results
  ↓
Streamlit Visualization
```

### 6.3 Document Generation Flow

```
User Request (Streamlit)
  ↓
DocumentGenerator.generate_specification()
  ↓
ItemLoader.load_all()
  ↓
Jinja2 Template Rendering
  ↓
Markdown → HTML → PDF
  ↓
Generated Document
```

